<worksheet>
    <title>Problem 14 - Written Homework - MTH 204</title>

    <p>
        You should write up solutions neatly to all problems, making sure to
        show all your work and follow the homework policies (see Blackboard
        document for details).
        You will turn in the hand-written assignment in person during Wednesday
        class time.
        The solutions you turn in should be your own work and written in your
        own words.
